# Project context

- Read **`CLAUDE.md`** at session start (stack, graph hubs, milestone, learnings).
- Read **`ARCHITECTURE.md`** before non-trivial features, refactors, or new modules.
- Run project **build and test** commands from `AGENTS.md` after code changes.
- Prefer **graphify** (`graphify-out/`, graph MCP) over whole-repo text search.
- Do not hardcode secrets; validate external input at boundaries.
- Match existing naming, layout, and patterns in the codebase.
